Package: mediahuman-batch
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-tk, pkexec
Maintainer: Nélio Gouvêa <nelioalvesgouvea@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/NelioGouvea/mediahuman-batch
Description: Importa playlists do YouTube para o MediaHuman YouTube to MP3
 Extrai os vídeos de playlists do YouTube com yt-dlp e os envia para a
 lista do MediaHuman YouTube to MP3. Não inicia downloads.
